itten or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Describing and Solving a Technical Problem", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you have a problem with your cell phone you call the company for help. You ask them to help you find a solution to the problem.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">George</span>: My phone isn't working.   </br>        <span class=\"strong\">Phone Agent</span>: Have you tried turning it on and off?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">George</span>: Whenever I use my phone I hear crackling.    </br>      <span class=\"strong\">Phone Agent</span>: I suggest you bring the phone in. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Describing a Problem\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Solving a Problem\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It seems to ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Try resetting the ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm having problems ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Did you try ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The screen always ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Try ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Whenever I use the ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I suggest ...\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Responding Politely to Suggestions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you are given a suggestion, you should always respond in a <span class=\"strong italic\">polite</span> way. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">James</span>: You ought to call her right now!</br>  <span class=\"strong\">Andrew</span>:  Yeah, I know. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">James</span>: You ought to call her this afternoon.</br> <span class=\"strong\">Andrew</span>: You're right. I should.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Suggestion\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Polite Response\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You should try turning your phone off then on again.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">OK. I've done that.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You ought to do that right now! </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yeah, I know. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You'd better call the phone company. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You're right.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "connection", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something that joins or connects two or more things", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: During the storm, they lost their phone connection.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you are having phone troubles.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "interference", "type": "name"}, {"content": "signals that weaken or block a phone conversation", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There was too much interference on the phone to hear what she was saying.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "crackling", "type": "name"}, {"content": "making snapping sounds", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: All I heard on my phone was crackling.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to troubleshoot", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to find out why something isn't working correctly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can try troubleshooting from here.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "at your end", "type": "name"}, {"content": "from your side", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Can you do anything at your end?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Think of five technical problems you could have with your computer or phone.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a set of questions to ask the technician.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write solutions to the problems beside the questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your questions aloud.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice them until they sound natural.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I  prepare questions related to technical problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I  write questions about the problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I  write solutions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I  practice my questions aloud.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le07ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le07ob05re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn6le07ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn6le07ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-130\">Peter</span>: I'm nervous about calling Tracy. I'd better wait till later.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Robert</span>: You're asking her out again, right? You should just call. You'll do great! You ought to do it right now! </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah, I know. OK. Here goes. I don't believe it! My phone isn't working!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Robert</span>: You'd better call the phone company. Here, use my phone.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You're right. Thanks.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn6le07ob05re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong  prelo-dialogue-130\">Telephone Technician</span>: Hello, City Phones. How can I help you?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I can't get a connection on my phone. All I hear is crackling. There's only interference.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Telephone Technician</span>: You should try turning your phone off, then on again.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: OK. I've done that. Can you do anything at your end?", "time": "25500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn6le07ob05re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong  prelo-dialogue-130\">Telephone Technician</span>: OK, I'm going to check the connection from here. I'll just troubleshoot yo